    "text": "By Carl Hunnell ,\n13 hours ago MANSFIELD — Mansfield Police Chief Jason Bammann had a message Wednesday morning for folks trying to spoil good things happening in the community. “There are a lot of good things here that haven’t happened in years. We’re very fortunate. For those that choose to destroy or hinder the work going on this city, you will be caught and you will pay the price,” Bammann said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
